        "answer": {
          "short": "$y'=-\\dfrac{59}{(7x-3)^2}$",
          "worked": "$u=8x+5$, $u'=8$, $v=7x-3$, $v'=7$.\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=\\frac{u'v-uv'}{v^2}\\\\&=\\frac{8(7x-3)-7(8x+5)}{(7x-3)^2}\\\\&=\\frac{56x-24-56x-35}{(7x-3)^2}\\\\&=-\\frac{59}{(7x-3)^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
